<%- include('../../partials/header', { title }) %>

<section class="space-y-6">
  <div>
    <a href="/account/credentials" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">&larr; 返回凭证列表</a>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">添加 API Key</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">
      粘贴你在 Anthropic / OpenAI 控制台生成的 API key。提交时我们会用一个最小请求 ping 一下,
      确认 key 可用后才会落库。
    </p>
  </div>

  <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-red-800">
      <%= error %>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <form action="/account/credentials" method="post" class="space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">

    <div>
      <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Provider</label>
      <div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border <%= selectedProvider === 'anthropic' ? 'border-slate-900 bg-slate-50' : 'border-slate-200 bg-white' %> p-3 hover:border-slate-400">
          <input type="radio" name="provider" value="anthropic" <%= selectedProvider === 'anthropic' ? 'checked' : '' %> class="mt-0.5">
          <span>
            <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">Anthropic</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">Claude(模型如 claude-sonnet-4-6)</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border <%= selectedProvider === 'openai' ? 'border-slate-900 bg-slate-50' : 'border-slate-200 bg-white' %> p-3 hover:border-slate-400">
          <input type="radio" name="provider" value="openai" <%= selectedProvider === 'openai' ? 'checked' : '' %> class="mt-0.5">
          <span>
            <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">OpenAI</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">GPT 系列(模型如 gpt-4o)</span>
          </span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="label" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Label</label>
      <input id="label" name="label" type="text" required maxlength="120"
             value="<%= label || '' %>"
             placeholder="例如:个人 Anthropic 主账号"
             class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-slate-900">
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">仅用于你自己区分多条凭证。</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="api_key" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">API Key</label>
      <div class="relative mt-1">
        <input id="api_key" name="api_key" type="password" required autocomplete="off"
               placeholder="sk-ant-... 或 sk-..."
               class="block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 pr-20 font-mono text-sm focus:border-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-slate-900">
        <button type="button"
                onclick="(function(){var i=document.getElementById('api_key'); i.type = (i.type === 'password' ? 'text' : 'password');})()"
                class="absolute inset-y-0 right-2 my-1 rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white px-2 text-xs text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50">
          显示 / 隐藏
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">
        我们不会以任何形式记录你的明文 key。提交后会立刻被加密(AES-256-GCM)。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-2">
      <a href="/account/credentials"
         class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50">
        取消
      </a>
      <button type="submit"
              class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-slate-700">
        测活并保存
      </button>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>

<%- include('../../partials/footer') %>
